{
  "schema": "ak-nf23-observer-payload-spec/1.0.0",
  "description": "SYNTHETIC payload shape specification for the NF23 observer in-process benchmark cases (work order docs/devplan-next-frontier-20260924-r1/work-orders/NF23-observer-benchmark.md H23.1/H23.2). All payloads are synthetic constructions driven only by this spec plus the frozen workload seed; they contain no market data, no credentials, and never touch a real client, socket, or the deployed service. The workload module tools/benchmarks/workloads/observer.py reads this file; it is hash-frozen as a case fixture by the C20 harness.",
  "shared": {
